  "body": "### Issue Description\r\n\r\n`fib/test_fib.py::test_hash[ipv6]` fails with `hash_key=ip-proto` when it uses `255`.\r\n```\r\n======================================================================\r\nFAIL: hash_test.HashTest\r\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"ptftests/py3/hash_test.py\", line 558, in runTest\r\n    self.check_hash(hash_key)\r\n  File \"ptftests/py3/hash_test.py\", line 209, in check_hash\r\n    hash_key, src_port, dst_ip, exp_port_lists)\r\n  File \"ptftests/py3/hash_test.py\", line 224, in check_ip_route\r\n    hash_key, src_port, dst_port_lists)\r\n  File \"ptftests/py3/hash_test.py\", line 426, in check_ipv6_route\r\n    self, masked_exp_pkt, dst_ports, timeout=1)\r\n  File \"/root/env-python3/lib/python3.7/site-packages/ptf/testutils.py\", line 3444, in verify_packet_any_port\r\n    % (ports, device_number, result.format())\r\nAssertionError: Did not receive expected packet on any of ports [0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5] for device 0.\r\n========== EXPECTED ==========\r\nMask:\r\n\r\npacket status: OK\r\npacket:\r\n0000  00 01 02 03 04 05 00 06 07 08 09 0A 86 DD 60 00  ..............`.\r\n0010  00 00 00 2E FF 3F 20 D0 A8 00 00 00 00 00 00 00  .....? .........\r\n0020  00 00 00 00 00 00 20 D0 A8 00 00 00 00 01 00 00  ...... .........\r\n0030  00 00 00 00 00 00 04 D2 00 50 00 00 00 00 00 00  .........P......\r\n0040  00 00 50 02 20 00 81 8D 00 00 44 44 44 44 44 44  ..P. .....DDDDDD\r\n0050  44 44 44 44 44 44 44 44 44 44 44 44 44 44 44 44  DDDDDDDDDDDDDDDD\r\n0060  44 44 44 44                                      DDDD\r\n```\r\n\r\nI reproduced this by running the ptf script again:\r\n```\r\n/root/env-python3/bin/ptf --test-dir ptftests/py3 hash_test.HashTest --platform-dir ptftests --qlen=20000 --platform remote -t \"fib_info_files=['/root/fib_info_all_duts.txt'];ptf_test_port_map='/root/ptf_test_port_map.json';hash_keys\r\n=['src-ip', 'dst-ip', 'src-port', 'dst-port', 'ip-proto'];src_ip_range='20D0:A800:0:00::,20D0:FFFF:0:00::FFFF';dst_ip_range='20D0:A800:0:01::,20D0:FFFF:0:01::FFFF';vlan_ids=[1032, 1033, 1034, 1035, 1036, 1037, 1038, 1039, 1040, 1041, 1042, 1043, 1044, 10\r\n45, 1046, 1047, 1048, 1049, 1050, 1051, 1052, 1053, 1054, 1055, 1056, 1057, 1058, 1059, 1060, 1061, 1062, 1063, 1064, 1065, 1066, 1067, 1068, 1069, 1070, 1071, 1072, 1073, 1074, 1075, 1076, 1077, 1078, 1079, 1080, 1081, 1082, 1083, 1084, 1085, 1086, 1087\r\n, 1088, 1089, 1090, 1091, 1092, 1093, 1094, 1095, 1096, 1097, 1098, 1099, 1100, 1101, 1102, 1103, 1104, 1105, 1106, 1107, 1108, 1109, 1110, 1111, 1112, 1113, 1114, 1115, 1116, 1117, 1118, 1119, 1120, 1121, 1122, 1123, 1124, 1125, 1126, 1127, 1128, 1129,\r\n1130, 1131, 1132, 1133, 1134, 1135, 1136, 1137, 1138, 1139, 1140, 1141, 1142, 1143, 1144, 1145, 1146, 1147, 1148, 1149, 1150, 1151, 1152, 1153, 1154, 1155, 1156, 1157, 1158, 1159, 1160, 1161, 1162, 1163, 1164, 1165, 1166, 1167, 1168, 1169, 1170, 1171, 11\r\n72, 1173, 1174, 1175, 1176, 1177, 1178, 1179, 1180, 1181, 1182, 1183, 1184, 1185, 1186, 1187, 1188, 1189, 1190, 1191, 1192, 1193, 1194, 1195, 1196, 1197, 1198, 1199, 1200, 1201, 1202, 1203, 1204, 1205, 1206, 1207, 1208, 1209, 1210, 1211, 1212, 1213, 1214\r\n, 1215, 1216, 1217, 1218, 1219, 1220, 1221, 1222, 1223, 1224, 1225, 1226, 1227, 1228, 1229, 1230, 1231, 1232, 1233, 1234, 1235, 1236, 1237, 1238, 1239, 1240, 1241, 1242, 1243, 1244\r\n, 1245, 1246, 1247, 1248, 1249, 1250, 1251, 1252, 1253, 1254, 1255, 1256, 1257, 1258, 1259, 1260, 1261, 1262, 1263, 1264, 1265, 1266, 1267, 1268, 1269, 1270, 1271, 1272, 1273, 1274, 1275, 1276, 1277, 1278];ignore_ttl=True;single_fib_for_duts='single-fib-\r\nsingle-hop';switch_type='voq';is_active_active_dualtor=False\" --relax --debug info --log-file /tmp/hash_test.HashTest.ipv6.2024-12-02-22:03:55.log --socket-recv-size 16384\r\n\r\n(Pdb) p hash_key                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              'ip-proto'\r\n(Pdb) p ip_proto\r\n255\r\n```\r\n\r\nIf I send the packet again:\r\n```\r\n(Pdb) send_packet( self, src_port, pkt, count=100 )\r\n10000\r\n```\r\n\r\nI can see the packet sent as:\r\n```\r\n16:39:46.124644 52:67:2c:8e:a0:09 (oui Unknown) > 94:8e:d3:1f:b0:fd (oui Unknown), ethertype IPv6 (0x86dd), length 100: 20d0:a800:: > 20d0:a800:0:1::: ip-proto-255 46\r\n        0x0000:  948e d31f b0fd 5267 2c8e a009 86dd 6000\r\n        0x0010:  0000 002e ff40 20d0 a800 0000 0000 0000\r\n        0x0020:  0000 0000 0000 20d0 a800 0000 0001 0000\r\n        0x0030:  0000 0000 0000 04d2 0050 0000 0000 0000\r\n        0x0040:  0000 5002 2000 818d 0000 4444 4444 4444\r\n        0x0050:  4444 4444 4444 4444 4444 4444 4444 4444\r\n        0x0060:  4444 4444\r\n```\r\n\r\nAnd returned from the dut as:\r\n```\r\n16:38:00.797992 94:8e:d3:5e:af:13 (oui Unknown) > 1e:bf:59:4c:90:6f (oui Unknown), ethertype IPv6 (0x86dd), length 96: truncated-ip6 - 4 bytes missing!20d0:a800:: > 20d0:a800:0:1::: ip-proto-255 46\r\n        0x0000:  1ebf 594c 906f 948e d35e af13 86dd 6000\r\n        0x0010:  0000 002e ff3f 20d0 a800 0000 0000 0000\r\n        0x0020:  0000 0000 0000 20d0 a800 0000 0001 0000\r\n        0x0030:  0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 5002\r\n        0x0040:  2000 818d 0000 4444 4444 4444 4444 4444\r\n        0x0050:  4444 4444 4444 4444 4444 4444 4444 4444\r\n```\r\n\r\nYou can see that the tcp-sport (04d2) and tcp-dport (0050) are removed.\r\n\r\n### Results you see\r\n\r\n`fib/test_fib.py::test_hash[ipv6]` fails with `hash_key=ip-proto`\r\n\r\n### Results you expected to see\r\n\r\n`fib/test_fib.py::test_hash[ipv6]` should pass with `hash_key=ip-proto`\r\n\r\n### Is it platform specific\r\n\r\ngeneric\r\n\r\n### Relevant log output\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### Output of `show version`\r\n\r\n_No response_\r\n\r\n### Attach files (if any)\r\n\r\n_No response_",
